Description: lightweight code editor with an embedded terminal
 Slayer Editor is a Qt 6 code editor with tabs, syntax highlighting,
 auto-indentation, auto-closing pairs, find/replace and several color themes.
 .
 An embedded terminal (QTermWidget) can be docked on the left, top, right or
 bottom of the window, or detached. Press F5 to compile and run the current
 file: C, C++, Python, Rust, Go, JavaScript, Java and shell scripts.

